{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1556","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"蚩（chī）蚩：忠厚的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"贸：交易，交换。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"匪：不是。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"来即我谋：到我这里来商量（婚事）。即，就、靠近。谋，谋划、商量。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"淇（qí）：淇水，在今河南境内。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"顿丘：地名，在今河南浚（xùn）县。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"愆（qiān）期：拖延婚期。愆，拖延。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"将（qiāng）：愿，请。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"乘：登上。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"垝（guǐ）垣：残破的墙。垝，毁坏。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"复关：卫国地名，氓所住的地方。一说，诗中借所居之地代指氓。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"载：助词，用在句首或句中，起加强语气的作用。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"尔卜尔筮（shì）：你用龟板占卜，用蓍（shī）草占卦。卜，用火烧龟板，根据龟板上的裂纹推断吉凶祸福。筮，用蓍草的茎占卦。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"体：占卜显示的兆象。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"咎言：不祥之语。咎，灾祸。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-15"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"贿：财物。这里指嫁妆。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-16"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"沃若：润泽的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-17"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"于嗟（xūjiē）鸠兮，无食桑葚：唉，斑鸠啊，你不要贪吃桑葚（旧说斑鸠吃多了桑葚会昏醉）。于嗟，感叹词。无，同“毋”，不要。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-18"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"无与士耽：不要同男子沉溺于爱情中。士，指未婚男子。耽，沉溺、沉醉。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-19"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"说（tuō）：同“脱”，摆脱、脱身。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-20"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"陨：陨落，坠下。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-21"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"徂（cú）：往。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-22"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"三岁食贫：多年来吃苦受贫。三岁，指多年。食贫，过贫苦的生活。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-23"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"汤（shāng）汤：水流盛大的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-24"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"渐（jiān）：浸湿。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-25"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"帷裳：车两旁的布幔。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-26"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"不爽：没有过错。爽，差错、过失。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-27"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"贰：不专一、有二心，跟“壹”相对。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-28"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"罔极：没有定准。罔，无。极，准则。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-29"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"二三其德：负德变心。二三，意思是反复无常，感情不专一。德，心意。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-30"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"靡室劳矣：家里的劳苦事没有一样不做的。靡，无、没有。室劳，家务劳动。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-31"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"靡有朝（zhāo）矣：没有一天不是如此。朝，日、天。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-32"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"言：助词，无实义。下文“静言思之”中的“言”用法与此相同。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-33"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"遂：如愿。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-34"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"咥（xì）：讥笑。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-35"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"悼：伤感，哀伤。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-36"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"及：和。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-37"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"老使我怨：这样只能使我怨恨不已。老，这里指上句二人盟誓相约“偕老”一事。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-38"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"淇则有岸，隰（xí）则有泮（pàn）：淇水有岸，池沼有边。隰，低湿的地方。一说指濕（tà）水，即漯水。泮，同“畔”，边、岸。这两句诗用淇水、池沼有岸，反衬男子心意无常，没有拘束限制。一说，这两句诗用淇水、池沼有岸，反衬妇人认为自己如与男子“偕老”，就会有无边的怨苦。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-39"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"总角之宴：少年时我和你一起愉快地玩耍。总角，古代少年男女把头发扎成丫髻，叫“总角”，后用以指代少年时代。宴，快乐。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-40"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"晏晏：和悦的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-41"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"旦旦：诚恳的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-42"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"反：违背。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-43"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"反是不思：违背誓言而不再顾及。是，指代二人的誓言。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-44"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"亦已焉哉：那就算了吧！已，止、了结。焉、哉，均为语气助词，连用以强化语气。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10411-45"}],"blocks":[{"type":"divider"},{"runs":[{"text":"氓之蚩蚩","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-10411-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，抱布贸","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-10411-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"丝。匪","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-10411-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"来贸丝，来即我谋","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-10411-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。送子涉淇","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-10411-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，至于顿丘","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-10411-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。匪我愆期","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-10411-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，子无良媒。将","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-10411-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"子无怒，秋以为期。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"乘","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-10411-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"彼垝垣","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-10411-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，以望复关","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-10411-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。不见复关，泣涕涟涟。既见复关，载","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-10411-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"笑载言。尔卜尔筮","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-10411-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，体","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-10411-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"无咎言","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-10411-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。以尔车来，以我贿","type":"text"},{"label":"[16]","noteId":"footnote-10411-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"迁。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"桑之未落，其叶沃若","type":"text"},{"label":"[17]","noteId":"footnote-10411-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。于嗟鸠兮，无食桑葚","type":"text"},{"label":"[18]","noteId":"footnote-10411-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！于嗟女兮，无与士耽","type":"text"},{"label":"[19]","noteId":"footnote-10411-19","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！士之耽兮，犹可说","type":"text"},{"label":"[20]","noteId":"footnote-10411-20","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"也。女之耽兮，不可说也！","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"桑之落矣，其黄而陨","type":"text"},{"label":"[21]","noteId":"footnote-10411-21","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。自我徂","type":"text"},{"label":"[22]","noteId":"footnote-10411-22","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"尔，三岁食贫","type":"text"},{"label":"[23]","noteId":"footnote-10411-23","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。淇水汤汤","type":"text"},{"label":"[24]","noteId":"footnote-10411-24","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，渐","type":"text"},{"label":"[25]","noteId":"footnote-10411-25","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"车帷裳","type":"text"},{"label":"[26]","noteId":"footnote-10411-26","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。女也不爽","type":"text"},{"label":"[27]","noteId":"footnote-10411-27","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，士贰","type":"text"},{"label":"[28]","noteId":"footnote-10411-28","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"其行。士也罔极","type":"text"},{"label":"[29]","noteId":"footnote-10411-29","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，二三其德","type":"text"},{"label":"[30]","noteId":"footnote-10411-30","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"三岁为妇，靡室劳矣","type":"text"},{"label":"[31]","noteId":"footnote-10411-31","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。夙兴夜寐，靡有朝矣","type":"text"},{"label":"[32]","noteId":"footnote-10411-32","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。言","type":"text"},{"label":"[33]","noteId":"footnote-10411-33","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"既遂","type":"text"},{"label":"[34]","noteId":"footnote-10411-34","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"矣，至于暴矣。兄弟不知，咥","type":"text"},{"label":"[35]","noteId":"footnote-10411-35","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"其笑矣。静言思之，躬自悼","type":"text"},{"label":"[36]","noteId":"footnote-10411-36","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"矣。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"及","type":"text"},{"label":"[37]","noteId":"footnote-10411-37","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"尔偕老，老使我怨","type":"text"},{"label":"[38]","noteId":"footnote-10411-38","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。淇则有岸，隰则有泮","type":"text"},{"label":"[39]","noteId":"footnote-10411-39","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。总角之宴","type":"text"},{"label":"[40]","noteId":"footnote-10411-40","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，言笑晏晏","type":"text"},{"label":"[41]","noteId":"footnote-10411-41","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。信誓旦旦","type":"text"},{"label":"[42]","noteId":"footnote-10411-42","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，不思其反","type":"text"},{"label":"[43]","noteId":"footnote-10411-43","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。反是不思","type":"text"},{"label":"[44]","noteId":"footnote-10411-44","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，亦已焉哉","type":"text"},{"label":"[45]","noteId":"footnote-10411-45","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"divider"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"诗无达诂","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"如何读透一首课外古诗词？干货版：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"字词功底，勾连成语，课内是基础。上课学会是关键，三次言两次一样一次不一样：），日常应用之“于嗟”“爽”“夙兴夜寐”考了，信誓旦旦可不可以考？","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"勾连上下文的意识与能力：全文多处照应，怒与暴，三次淇水，氓子士变化","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"诗歌跳跃，补足情境，字词之下的事情与心情，技巧：视角，换位，代入自己","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"叙事诗，厘清时间线故事线，叙事与议论抒情分开","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"文学文化常识：弃妇诗/叙事诗/现实主义/比兴有几处/朱熹淫妇说的思考/因何不朽","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"从氓的视角，故事是怎样的？","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"忘记如上一切后，我们如何面对自己的情不知所起一往而深……","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"ordered":true,"type":"list"}],"type":"quote"},{"runs":[{"alt":"A Chinese webpage displays a reading comprehension exercise featuring the poem \"采葛\" and related questions.","mediaId":"media-bb801d6e8917e3b8caab","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/u1fSJYGXssSMBrKEgg8amgAKmXI.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/u1fSJYGXssSMBrKEgg8amgAKmXI.pdf","text":"程俊英《氓》.pdf","type":"link"},{"text":" (628.4 KB)\n\n","type":"text"},{"disposition":